<div id="S4.SS1.SSS0.Px2.1" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="S4.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text">We will discuss cases when <math id="S4.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathscr{G}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathscript">𝒢</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathscr{G}</annotation></semantics></math> is complete bipartite graph and if <math id="S4.SS1.SSS0.Px2.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathscr{G}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathscript">𝒢</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathscr{G}</annotation></semantics></math> is not complete bipartite graph.</span></p>
</div>
